==Description==
:This template is a shorthand for <nowiki>[[miraheze:_wiki name_:<pagename>]]</nowiki>.
:It links a page from an existing Miraheze wiki or Fandom wiki.

==How to Make a New Interwiki Template?==
Here, you just need to fill this preload and all done~
<inputbox>
type=create
preload=Template:Interwiki/Preload
default=Template:YourTemplateName
width=50
placeholder=Enter singer name
</inputbox>

Example of YourTemplateName: MafuWiki, AmatsukiWiki, EveWiki, OdoWiki, EnsouWiki, etc

==Samples==
:<code><nowiki>{{templatename|PAGENAME}}</nowiki></code> 
:<code><nowiki>{{templatename|wiki name|page name}}</nowiki></code> if you want to link a page.
:<code><nowiki>{{templatename|wiki name|page name|name}}</nowiki></code> if you want the link to appear in another name.

